 "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01LQ:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下一个引理指出，构造相对谱（relative spectrum）与基变换（base change）可交换（commutes），这只是该引理的结论之一。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "可交换"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱", "context": "指下一个引理讨论其构造的对象。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "指与构造相对谱交换的操作。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "可交换", "context": "指两种构造操作之间的交换关系。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01LX:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为一个由<MATH_0003>-代数（algebras）组成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。令<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上的相对谱（relative spectrum）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0007>，其逆（inverse）像（image）<MATH_0008>均为仿射的（affine）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 对每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>，都有<MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n泛（universal）映射（map）<MATH_0011>是<MATH_0012>-代数（algebras）的一个同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universal", "target_term": "泛"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指相对谱的底概形。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指所给层所带的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "指用来构造相对谱的层。"}, {"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱", "context": "指引理所刻画的概形。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指取逆像的任意仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆", "context": "与下一条像合为逆像。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "与上一条逆合为逆像。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "指逆像具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指第二项中任取的态射。"}, {"source_term": "universal", "target_term": "泛", "context": "修饰相对谱定义所给的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指第三项断言为同构的泛映射。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指该同构保有的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指泛映射是代数同构。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01LX:proof", "translation": "第（1）项由相对谱（relative spectrum）的粘合（glueing）描述得出，见引理<REF_0001>。\n第（2）项直接由引理<REF_0002>得出。\n第（3）项成立，因为它在<MATH_0001>上是局部的（local），且在<MATH_0002>为仿射的（affine）情形下可知其成立，例如见引理<REF_0003>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部的"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱", "context": "指通过粘合给出描述的对象。"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "指建立该相对谱的局部描述所用的方法。"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部的", "context": "指第三项可在所给概形上局部验证。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "指所引引理可直接处理的情形。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01LY:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个拟紧的（quasi-compact）、拟分离的（quasi-separated）概形（schemes）态射（morphism）。由《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0001>，层（sheaf）<MATH_0002>是由<MATH_0003>-代数（algebras）组成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。存在一个典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0004>，它是<MATH_0005>上的概形（schemes）之间的态射。对任意仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0006>，限制（restriction）<MATH_0007>可等同于典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0008>，后者来自《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的", "context": "指对给定态射的第一个假设。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的", "context": "指对给定态射的第二个假设。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指给定态射的源和靶所属的对象类型。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指满足所列两个条件的态射。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指用于得到层的拟凝聚性的引用所在章。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指引理所述的层。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指该层的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "指该代数层的性质。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "指本引理断言存在的态射。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指典范态射源和靶在给定底上的对象类型。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指用来限制典范态射的任意仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "指将典范态射限制到该开集的结果。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "指与限制等同的态射。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指提供后一个典范态射的引理所在章。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01LY:proof", "translation": "所述态射（morphism）由如下构造得到：将<MATH_0001>定义为表示（representing）函子（functor）<MATH_0002>的概形（scheme），再由典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0003>得到该态射（由推前（push）与拉回（pull）的伴随性（adjointness），该映射对应于<MATH_0004>）。\n关于到<MATH_0005>的限制（restriction）的陈述，由仿射概形（affines）上的相对谱（relative spectrum）的描述得出，见引理<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "push", "target_term": "推前"}, {"source_term": "pull", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "adjointness", "target_term": "伴随性"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指本引理构造的态射。"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示", "context": "指在定义中用该概形表示给定函子。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指给定定义中所表示的函子。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指以表示该函子的方式定义的概形。"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "指通过表示性质给出所述态射的映射。"}, {"source_term": "push", "target_term": "推前", "context": "指伴随关系中的正向操作。"}, {"source_term": "pull", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "指伴随关系中的逆向操作。"}, {"source_term": "adjointness", "target_term": "伴随性", "context": "指用于辨认对应映射的伴随关系。"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "指本引理的最后一句所描述的限制。"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "指描述相对谱时取作底的仿射概形。"}, {"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱", "context": "指借助其仿射底情形的描述得出限制的构造。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01LZ:title", "translation": "仿射（Affine）n 维空间（n-space）", "allowed_english": ["n"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "n-space", "target_term": "维空间"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "修饰本节讨论的空间。"}, {"source_term": "n-space", "target_term": "维空间", "context": "与前面的维数 n 一起指给定维数的空间。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01LZ:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n作为相对谱（relative spectrum）的一个应用，我们如下定义仿射（affine）<MATH_0001>维空间（-space），其底概形（base scheme）为<MATH_0002>。对任意整数（integer）<MATH_0003>，可以考虑由<MATH_0004>-代数（algebras）组成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0005>。它是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），因为作为一个由<MATH_0006>-模（modules）组成的层（sheaf），它正是<MATH_0007>的各个副本的直和（direct sum），这些副本以多重指标（multi-indices）为指标。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "-space", "target_term": "维空间"}, {"source_term": "base scheme", "target_term": "底概形"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "multi-indices", "target_term": "多重指标"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱", "context": "指用来定义仿射空间的构造。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "修饰所定义的空间。"}, {"source_term": "-space", "target_term": "维空间", "context": "与前面的维数占位符共同表示给定维数的空间。"}, {"source_term": "base scheme", "target_term": "底概形", "context": "指在其上构造仿射空间的概形。"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数", "context": "指可在构造中任取的整数。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指所构造的层的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "指构造仿射空间时所考虑的层。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的", "context": "指根据该层作为模层的直和描述得出的性质。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "指在验证拟凝聚性时所用的模结构。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指把所构造的代数层视为模层。"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和", "context": "指用各个副本构成底层模层的运算。"}, {"source_term": "multi-indices", "target_term": "多重指标", "context": "指用于编排直和中各副本的指标。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01M0:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个概形（scheme），且<MATH_0002>。概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>之上，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>仿射（affine）<MATH_0005>维空间（space）（在<MATH_0006>上）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。若<MATH_0007>是仿射的（affine），则也称之为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>仿射（affine）<MATH_0008>维空间（space）（在<MATH_0009>上）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，并记作<MATH_0010>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指本定义中给定的概形。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指在给定底上构造并命名的概形。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "修饰第一个名称中的空间。"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间", "context": "指第一个名称中维数由占位符指定的空间。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "指使用第二个名称所需的条件。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "修饰第二个名称中的空间。"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间", "context": "指第二个名称中维数由占位符指定的空间。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01LZ:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意<MATH_0001>。对任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>（概形（schemes）之间的态射），都有<MATH_0003>，因而<MATH_0004>就是基变换（base change）。所以，仿射（affine）<MATH_0005>维空间（-space）也可由公式<MATH_0006>定义。此外，从<MATH_0007>-概形（scheme）<MATH_0008>到<MATH_0009>的一个态射（morphism），由下列<MATH_0010>-代数（algebras）同态（homomorphism）给出：\n<MATH_0011>。\n这显然等价于给出<MATH_0012>的像（images）。换言之，从<MATH_0013>到<MATH_0014>在<MATH_0015>上的一个态射（morphism），等价于给出<MATH_0016>个元素（elements）<MATH_0017>。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "-space", "target_term": "维空间"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "images", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指为得到基变换公式而任取的态射。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指任取的态射的源和靶所属的对象类型。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "指由前一关系得到的基变换。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "修饰由另一公式定义的空间。"}, {"source_term": "-space", "target_term": "维空间", "context": "与前面的维数占位符共同表示给定维数的空间。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指给定态射的源概形。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指由代数同态确定的态射。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指同态保持的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "指给出上述态射的代数同态。"}, {"source_term": "images", "target_term": "像", "context": "指只须指定的各个像。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指在指定底上的态射。"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "指给出该态射所需的指定个数的元素。"}], "notes": []}
